 "name_en": "Electronic Documents (2RP)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Electronic Documents (2RP)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio273616e3d6a748bd8b2ab9efccf8ac79\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio273616e3d6a748bd8b2ab9efccf8ac79__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">In this scope item, you can integrate <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> with SAP Document Compliance, outbound invoicing option for Brazil (nota fiscal eletronica). The service converts the nota fiscal data from <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> to an electronic format, and manages the proper communication with the government to send and receive the data. The SAP Document Compliance, outbound invoicing option for Brazil (nota fiscal eletronica) requires an additional subscription license.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">With this integration, you can send electronic documents to the Brazilian government to receive authorization for different processes, such as authorization and cancellation. The government authorization assures legal validity for the requested documents.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio273616e3d6a748bd8b2ab9efccf8ac79__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Main Processes:</p>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Connect to Brazilian tax authorities: NF-e with SEFAZ and NFS-e for São Paulo and Rio de Janeiro cities</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Send operational requests: authorization, cancellation, correction letters, skipping</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Send XML to business partners</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Download XML files</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Provide XML storage</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\">Contingencies:</p>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Contingency Virtual SEFAZ (SVC)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Security Paper Contingency</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\">Gaps:</p>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">GAP Report to send numbering gaps</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">GAP Monitor to check gaps status</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\">Additional Functionalities from Monitor:</p>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">SEFAZ Service status check</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Switch to contingency</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Cancel prior to authorization</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Reset document status</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio273616e3d6a748bd8b2ab9efccf8ac79__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Ensure compliance with Brazilian government systems</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Get authorization for different processes such as authorization and cancellation of invoices</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>电子凭证 (2RP)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio273616e3d6a748bd8b2ab9efccf8ac79\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio273616e3d6a748bd8b2ab9efccf8ac79__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">在此范围项目中，您可以将 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 与 SAP Document Compliance 面向巴西市场的出站开票选项 (nota fiscal eletronica) 集成。该服务将发票数据从 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 转换为电子格式，并管理与政府的正确通信以发送和接收数据。SAP Document Compliance 面向巴西市场的出站开票选项 (nota fiscal eletronica) 需要附加订阅许可证。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">通过此集成，您可以向巴西政府发送电子凭证，以接收不同流程的权限，例如授权和取消。政府权限确保所请求凭证的法律有效性。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio273616e3d6a748bd8b2ab9efccf8ac79__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">主要流程：</p>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">连接到巴西税务机关：具有 SEFAZ 的 NF-e 和用于圣保罗和里约热内卢城市的 NFS-e</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">发送操作请求：授权、取消、更正信函、跳过</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将 XML 发送给业务伙伴</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">下载 XML 文件</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">提供 XML 存储</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\">应急：</p>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">应急虚拟 SEFAZ (SVC)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">安全文件应急</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\">差距：</p>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">发送编号间隔的差距报表</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">用于检查差距状态的差距监控器</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\">监控器中的附加功能：</p>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">SEFAZ 服务状态检查</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">切换到应急</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">授权前取消</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">重置凭证状态</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio273616e3d6a748bd8b2ab9efccf8ac79__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">确保遵守巴西政府制度</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">获取不同流程的权限，例如发票的授权和取消</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
